{%- comment -%}
  Single source of truth for the "Hand Delivered by Founder" fee, in paise.
  MUST match the "Hand Delivered by Founder" shipping rate in
  Shopify admin > Settings > Shipping and delivery (that rate is what
  checkout actually charges). 300000 = Rs. 3,000.

  Usage: {%- capture fee -%}{% render 'founder-fee-cents' %}{%- endcapture -%}
         {%- assign fee_cents = fee | plus: 0 -%}
{%- endcomment -%}
300000
